1. What would we expect to see if small-value cases remain open because owner=
ship is unclear?
2. What evidence would instead support that older cases cluster in one proces=
s?
3. How do we rule out that status updates close records without resolving the=
 transaction?

Please work towards the exception priority rule and escalation threshold. A u=
